recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the merge lands and its law is proven both ways, so the lane's next movement is the annotation that shows what each side did. Two doors want your word first: the identity that would let two branches both insert collides with a rostered guard locking Line to three fields, and %446's rule pair is Incense's lane to reconcile.
